(/*) 54 368.2 T
( * Keyboard callback for the JotView. This handles:) 54 352.2 T
( *) 54 336.2 T
(Control-A moves to the beginning of the document.) 135 336.2 T
( *) 54 320.2 T
(Control-B moves backward one character.) 135 320.2 T
( *) 54 304.2 T
(Control-D deletes the character after the caret.) 135 304.2 T
( *) 54 288.2 T
(Control-E moves to the end of the document.) 135 288.2 T
( *) 54 272.2 T
(Control-F moves forward one character.) 135 272.2 T
( *) 54 256.2 T
(Delete deletes the character before the caret.) 135 256.2 T
( *) 54 240.2 T
( *) 54 224.2 T
( * All other characters are inserted in the text buffer based on the) 54 208.2 T
( * caret position. Following the insertion, the caret is) 54 192.2 T
( * advanced.) 54 176.2 T
( */) 54 160.2 T
